  "step_3": "The decision reason requires the use of an aspiration level (mean of outcomes, 1225 Euros) and a comparison of the probability of outcomes exceeding this level. The individual did not mention any reference to a mean or aspiration level, nor did they refer to positive deviations from a benchmark. Instead, they focused on the relative size of the gain and the closeness of the probabilities. The individual’s justification aligns with a focus on the higher payoff when probabilities are similar, which is inconsistent with the rule of the given reason (which would favor Lottery B due to its higher probability of positive deviation). Therefore, the individual did not use the specified decision reason. The reasoning process described does not match the structure of the reason, and no mention of the aspiration level or the comparison of positive differences is present.",
